@startuml
' Selected dependencies between the existing classes, grouped by responsibility.
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam shadowing false

component "BusyNotFree\nApplication loop" as App
component "CommandHandler\nSpecialised handlers" as Commands
component "CommandParser\nArgumentParser" as Parsers
component "Ui\nClientUi" as UI
component "Managers and records\nbusynotfree.model" as Model
component "DataStorage" as Storage
artifact "data/busynotfree.properties" as File

App ..> Commands : dispatches input
App ..> UI : displays prompts\nand errors
App ..> Storage : loads / saves
Commands ..> Parsers : parses input
Commands ..> Model : queries / updates
Commands ..> UI : presents results
UI ..> Model : reads records
Storage ..> Model : serialises / reconstructs
Storage ..> File : reads / writes UTF-8

@enduml
